Third-party data

The MIT licence above covers this project's source code only. Data the app
fetches or displays is licensed by its providers and is not covered by MIT:
race data from the Jolpica F1 API and session data from OpenF1 (both
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), circuit layouts from julesr0y/f1-circuits-svg (CC BY 4.0),
and country flags from Flagpedia (flagcdn.com). See the credits in the app's
Settings > About screen.

